'[Mission Dialog]'

'[info]'
briefing = "Besieged
Date:  May 5, 1993 - 1330 hours
Location:  Mogadishu, Somalia

Situation:
A convoy of Pakistani U.N. soldiers are under heavy fire in grid Charlie Two. They have at least one truck destroyed and are surrounded. Get your team to their location and help them pass the roadblock that has them trapped.";
briefing2 = "<cFC8932>Besieged <-co>
OPORD: 4-93, TFR  Div 3    Date Time: 051330 May 93	

1. <ucFC8932>Situation<-uco>
A convoy of Pakistani U.N. Soldiers is under heavy fire in grid Charlie Two. They have at least one truck destroyed and are surrounded.
      <cFC8932>Weather:<-co>  Hot, sunny.
      <cFC8932>Terrain:<-co> City, urban.
      <cFC8932>Enemy:<-co>  Minimum of forty Habr Gedir militia. AK 47's, RPG's, Technicals.
      <cFC8932>Friendly:<-co> None

2. <ucFC8932>Mission<-uco> 
      <cFC8932>Who:<-co> Ranger Team Two-One
      <cFC8932>What:<-co> Insert by Humvee. Locate, reinforce and free the trapped convoy. 
      <cFC8932>When:<-co> Immediately following briefing.

3. <ucFC8932>Execution<-uco>
      <cFC8932>Commanders Intent:<-co>  Quickly locate Pakistani's and reinforce their position and facilitate their escape.
      <cFC8932>Concept of Operation:<-co>  Move by vehicle to U.N. forces. Set up a secure perimeter and work to dismantle any resistance and roadblocks that prevent their movement.
      <cFC8932>Coordinating instructions: <-co>  1st squad assault. 

4. <ucFC8932>Service and Support<-uco>
      <cFC8932>Basic Load:<-co>  M16, M9 Beretta, Satchel Charge

5. <ucFC8932>Command and signal<-uco>
	SOP
";
title = "Besieged";

